# Text formatting: code between backticks, in the font of Code font.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: en
	Title: Text formatting · Code
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 20mm
	Styles:
		For style: source
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Mono
				Size: 9
				Color: muted
				Markup: none
		For style: result
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 14 0
			Typography:
